          "text": "{\"findings\":[{\"refs\":[\"J14\",\"J8\"],\"finding\":\"Both are Aeroplan economy awards at 65,000 points, but their reported schedules differ: J14 leaves Jan 15 at 23:15 and arrives Jan 17 at 09:50 (1,175 min); J8 leaves Jan 15 at 11:45 and arrives Jan 16 at 22:25 (1,180 min). J8 arrives on the prior local date despite taking 5 minutes longer.\"},{\"refs\":[\"J101\",\"J43\"],\"finding\":\"These report matching SFO–LAX–IST–BKK schedules (Jan 15 06:18 departure; Jan 17 08:50 arrival; 2,132 min), with economy at 110,000 Turkish points versus business at 275,000. Both are conditional separate-ticket journeys; schedule matching does not establish identical physical flights or other booking facts, and the economy option means business is not needed to obtain this schedule.\"},{\"refs\":[\"J102\",\"J44\"],\"finding\":\"Matching reported schedule: Jan 15 08:55 departure, Jan 17 08:50 arrival, 1,975 min. Economy is 110,000 Turkish points and business 275,000; both are conditional separate-ticket journeys. The matching schedule does not prove identical physical flights or booking facts.\"},{\"refs\":[\"J103\",\"J45\"],\"finding\":\"Matching reported schedule: Jan 15 07:00 departure, Jan 17 08:50 arrival, 2,090 min. Economy is 110,000 Turkish points and business 275,000; both are conditional separate-ticket journeys. The matching schedule does not prove identical physical flights or booking facts.\"},{\"refs\":[\"J27\",\"J35\",\"J159\",\"J167\"],\"finding\":\"J27/J35 (economy, 110,000 Turkish points) and J159/J167 (business, 275,000) have the same reported SFO–LAX–IST–BKK schedule: Jan 15 06:18 departure to Jan 17 04:15 arrival, 1,857 min. The economy choices match the business schedule; all are conditional separate-ticket journeys, and schedule matching does not establish identical physical flights or booking facts.\"}]}",
